は休止）、食堂、休憩室がある。","夏季限定の延長営業は8月23日までの告知で、通常営業時間とは別。"],"quality":"grounded","policyVersion":"official-provenance-v2"},"n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["city.sakata.lg.jp"],"urls":["https://www.city.sakata.lg.jp/sangyo/kanko/rejyashisetsu/yurinko.html"]}]},"w339299655":{"checked":"2026-08-08","facts":[{"conflict":false,"k":"price","n":10,"official":true,"src":["city.obanazawa.yamagata.jp","mapple.net","ekitan.com","rurubu.jp","yumap.jp","gltjp.com","yuumies.jp","clipyamagata.com","xn--octt84bmki.com","4travel.jp"],"urls":["https://www.city.obanazawa.yamagata.jp/kanko/kankochi/3651","https://www.mapple.net/spot/6010214/","https://www.ekitan.com/local-info/leisure/spot/spid-4fe7e4a5cc992e5b1e3f752471e0e198","https://rurubu.jp/andmore/spot/80004836","https://yumap.jp/yamagata/spot/3423","https://www.gltjp.com/ja/directory/item/14577/","https://yuumies.jp/onsens/2jq8ifsGGD71MTDnT1nLr9","https://clipyamagata.com/shiroganeyu","https://www.xn--octt84bmki.com/%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B0%E3%82%8A%E6%B8%A9%E6%B3%89/yamagata-ginzan-shiroganeyu/","https://4travel.jp/travelogue/11926926"],"v":500},{"conflict":true,"k":"hours","n":2,"official":true,"src":["city.obanazawa.yamagata.jp","gltjp.com"],"urls":["https://www.city.obanazawa.yamagata.jp/kanko/kankochi/3651","https://www.city.obanazawa.yamagata.jp/kanko/kankochi/1346","https://www.gltjp.com/ja/directory/item/14577/"],"v":"9:00-16:00(最終受付15:30)"},{"conflict":true,"k":"hours","n":3,"official":false,"src":["ginzanonsen.jp","ekitan.com","rurubu.jp"],"urls":["https://www.ginzanonsen.jp/blog/archives/39","https://www.ekitan.com/local-info/leisure/spot/spid-4fe7e4a5cc992e5b1e3f752471e0e198","https://rurubu.jp/andmore/spot/80004836"],"v":"8:30-16:00(最終受付15:30)"},{"conflict":true,"k":"hours","n":2,"official":false,"src":["yumap.jp","clipyamagata.com"],"urls":["https://yumap.jp/yamagata/spot/3423","https://clipyamagata.com/shiroganeyu"],"v":"8:00-17:00(最終受付16:30)"},{"conflict":true,"k":"hours","n":1,"official":false,"src":["yuumies.